sequenceDiagram
    participant Supervisor
    participant LoadMemoryNode
    participant ConversationNodes
    participant UpdateMemoryNode
    participant WriteMemoryNode
    participant SummarizeNode
    participant MongoDB

    Note over Supervisor: New turn begins — query received

    Supervisor->>LoadMemoryNode: load_long_term_memory(case_id, user_id)
    LoadMemoryNode->>MongoDB: fetch semantic_facts (keyed by case_id)
    MongoDB-->>LoadMemoryNode: semantic_facts[]
    LoadMemoryNode->>MongoDB: fetch procedural_prefs (keyed by user_id)
    MongoDB-->>LoadMemoryNode: procedural_prefs[]
    LoadMemoryNode-->>Supervisor: inject into state

    Supervisor->>ConversationNodes: process turn
    Note over ConversationNodes: classify_intent → enrich_context → dispatch_agents → merge_responses → verify_citations → validate_output
    ConversationNodes-->>Supervisor: validated response + updated conversation_history

    Supervisor->>Supervisor: increment messages_since_last_summary

    alt messages_since_last_summary exceeds threshold
        Supervisor->>SummarizeNode: compress older turns → running_summary [high LLM]
        SummarizeNode-->>Supervisor: running_summary (Arabic prose), reset counter
    end

    Supervisor->>UpdateMemoryNode: extract new facts + preference signals from turn
    UpdateMemoryNode-->>Supervisor: updated long_term_memory delta

    Supervisor->>WriteMemoryNode: write_long_term_memory(case_id, user_id)
    WriteMemoryNode->>MongoDB: upsert semantic_facts
    MongoDB-->>WriteMemoryNode: ack
    WriteMemoryNode->>MongoDB: upsert procedural_prefs
    MongoDB-->>WriteMemoryNode: ack

    Supervisor->>MongoDB: append audit_log entry (turn, intent, agents, validation_status)
    MongoDB-->>Supervisor: ack
